        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope and security notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Logical view from repository code; hosting and production topology are not asserted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The demo API accepts caller-supplied actor_id values. A production identity should come from verified authentication context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No cache, queue, CDN, or IoT service is represented because none is required by this implementation." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
